  "contentHtml": "<p>안녕하세요</p><p>&#160;아이들과 함께 실험하고 싶은데 잘 되지 않아 조언을 얻으려고 합니다. 두가지 질문이 있어요.&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>1. 전자기유도 기본 실험인 솔레노이드와 검류계, 네오디움자석을 이용해서 유도전류가 흐르고&#160;</p><p>넣고 뺄때 마다 방향이 바뀐다는 건 잘 확인할 수 있는데요&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>검류계대신에 LED를 넣으면 잘 안되네요&#160;</p><p>어떤 문제에 LED의 방향을 반대로 접합해서 전류를 흐르게 하면&#160;</p><p>유도전류의 방향에 따라 LED가 교대로 반짝거린다고 해서 그걸 해 보고 싶은데...</p><p>솔레노이드는 전류가 작아서 안되는 걸까요???(네오디움 자석 여러개 이용했어요)</p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvp9v8tpe4g30oq3hqp5jx8ia@my?service=daum_cafe\" data-video-host=\"kakaotv\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"712\" data-video-height=\"400\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://img1.daumcdn.net/thumb/S712x400/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Fthumb.kakaocdn.net%2Fdna%2Fkamp%2Fsource%2Frvp9v8tpe4g30oq3hqp5jx8ia%2Fthumbs%2F2.jpg%3Fcredential%3DTuMuFGKUIcirOSjFzOpncbomGFEIdZWK%26expires%3D33188755338%26signature%3DCy1mdvJhMKmyDSiQm0vMXI%252Bs%252Bqg%253D\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthFull\" data-video-origin-width=\"712\" data-video-origin-height=\"400\"><iframe src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvp9v8tpe4g30oq3hqp5jx8ia?service=daum_cafe&amp;f=p&amp;ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InJ2cDl2OHRwZTRnMzBvcTNocXA1ang4aWEiLCJ0aWQiOiI0ZjZjYTYwZi0xOTM5LTRhOGUtYTFmMy1iNzZlMjFjZDE1ZTUiLCJhcHBfaWQiOiJkYXVtX2NhZmUiLCJleHAiOjE3ODYxODE5NzN9.x22bByniafpJDskwowxCMJI2ITxK92nwo3xdVTT41JBFOnWTkozFUn3BS_thMhhkjRFzcW6ZRqux7brNguBWJg&amp;autoplay=0\" width=\"712\" height=\"400\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\" allow=\"encrypted-media\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\">무선 충전기에 솔레노이드와 LED를 올린 모습</div></div><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvdpilooyvofoh3xh20tvy1yf@my?service=daum_cafe\" data-video-host=\"kakaotv\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"712\" data-video-height=\"400\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://img1.daumcdn.net/thumb/S712x400/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Fthumb.kakaocdn.net%2Fdna%2Fkamp%2Fsource%2Frvdpilooyvofoh3xh20tvy1yf%2Fthumbs%2F2.jpg%3Fcredential%3DTuMuFGKUIcirOSjFzOpncbomGFEIdZWK%26expires%3D33188755377%26signature%3DeiKwlDaCmgdvfwVj5%252Bjfo%252FtiJVQ%253D\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthFull\" data-video-origin-width=\"712\" data-video-origin-height=\"400\"><iframe src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvdpilooyvofoh3xh20tvy1yf?service=daum_cafe&amp;f=p&amp;ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InJ2ZHBpbG9veXZvZm9oM3hoMjB0dnkxeWYiLCJ0aWQiOiIzMTJmZTA4Mi03NDM3LTRmODAtYTc2Yy1hYjhhOTU2NWRhMWIiLCJhcHBfaWQiOiJkYXVtX2NhZmUiLCJleHAiOjE3ODYxODE5NzN9.upWs91qaaTPI_UwqIZU8PrWHDAPkww-4va0xsPNAlHEU81HKapyvsfZ0yr_zo2gGthIjXcDkCrrvWkK8a7vNrg&amp;autoplay=0\" width=\"712\" height=\"400\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\" allow=\"encrypted-media\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\">동시에 반짝거림</div></div><p>&#160;</p><p>2. 무선충전기도 유도전류를 발생시키고 그 유도전류로 다른 기기를 충전한다고 해서</p><p>무선충전기위에 솔레노이드를 올려 놓았더니 LED의 빛이 들어오는 걸 볼 수 있었어요.&#160;</p><p>그런데 여기서도 마찬가지로 극이 다른 LED를 올려놓으면 교대로 반짝거려야 하는게 아닌지....</p><p>같이 반짝거리더라구요.&#160;</p><p>이유를 알 수 있을까 해서 질문을 올립니다.&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
